  "prefLabel": "Rev 2207.03 Form MS-42, Statement of County Appropriations and Revenue as Voted",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2207.03 Form MS-42, Statement of County Appropriations and Revenue as Voted.\n\n(a) Form MS-42, “Statement of County Appropriations and Revenue as Voted”, shall be completed by the clerk of the county convention and a copy filed with the secretary of state and the department, pursuant to RSA 24:24, after the adoption of:\n\n(1) The budget by the county convention; and\n\n(2) Supplemental appropriations by the county convention.\n\nSource. #9486, eff 6-23-09 (formerly Rev 2208.01); ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2208.03); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2200.html"
